blocks.english:
Thou changest the elements;
Through Thee the sacraments
Bring forth their efficacy.
Thou repellest malignant power;
Thou overthrowest and confoundest
The wickedness of our enemies.

With Thee teaching, nothing is obscure;
With Thee present, nothing is impure;
All things are radiant.
The joyful mind exulteth;
Through Thee made sound, through Thee made clean,
The conscience rejoiceth.
